    "published": "2019-03-17T03:30:43.000Z",
    "title": "やがて海へと届く",
    "url": "https://lineblog.me/kano/archives/13218836.html",
    "archive": "https://web.archive.org/web/20190403024415/https://lineblog.me/kano/archives/13218836.html",
    "blocks": [
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "image",
            "alt": "mRFFkAjtZ1.jpg",
            "media": "301998340b1f.jpg",
            "source": "https://obs.line-scdn.net/0hD60ALoZUGxkNODHy5thkTk9lHXZ0WwERZ0AMI3huETd4VAwZZUIOL3dmWXdHcwUUNDgCLWN4LHV2fyIwdRsNNlZ-F1dSSiw8RT0NYyg8QSomClpHN1pUd3psQy8gDxlOOQxcfn1oQw"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "本が好きなひとだった。"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "是个爱看书的人。"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "They were someone who loved books."
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "漫画もよく読んでいた。"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "漫画也读了不少。"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "They read manga often too."
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "ゲームも好きで、アニメも好きで、動物も好きだった。"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "也喜欢游戏，喜欢动画，也喜欢小动物。"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "They liked games, they liked anime, they liked animals."
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "好きなことやものがたくさんあって、それ以上に嫌いなことや苦手なものがたくさんあったひとだった。"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "喜欢的东西和事有很多，可与之相比，讨厌的、不擅长的东西反而更多——就是这样一个人。"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "They were someone who had many things they liked, and even more things they disliked or were bad at."
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "いつか旅立つ「わたし」は、どんなひとなんだろう。"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "总有一天要启程远行的“我”，会变成什么样的人呢。"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "The \"me\" who will someday set out on a journey, what kind of person will I be?"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "知りたいような知りたくないような？？？？"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "既想知道，又不想知道？？？？"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Do I want to know, or do I not want to know????"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "鹿乃"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "titleZh": "终将抵达大海",
    "titleEn": "Yagate umi e to todoku (Eventually Reaching the Sea)"
  },
